      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1001/storytimeline_501001423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:365d351447b2c14d271132cd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "两人透过坚定的握手肯定这次的激战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1081b774f1c2ed644e7123ad8bba3db38ea09041f86786bc8a3d50a7a060247b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1001/storytimeline_501001423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29cc8eaa5a40371c4c30f95b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过草上飞却出现在回去的路程上，\n说要和特别周一决胜负。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e46b03ee55c784fc7af44988e56f4c4b8a1cc25ed7ddaa40d9d77b505db40d8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1001/storytimeline_501001423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f075701f8dafb58eb546fa9b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就这样，\n特别周决定要和“怪物”草上飞\n在“有马纪念”中一较高下了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "52b2536c7e5f414148d6d94782194f4188960be6d0d45d5a8aa17ee92d8730ba",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1001/storytimeline_501001423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
