      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过草上飞却出现在回去的路程上，\n说要和特别周一决胜负。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e46b03ee55c784fc7af44988e56f4c4b8a1cc25ed7ddaa40d9d77b505db40d8",
