      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就这样，\n特别周决定要和“怪物”草上飞\n在“有马纪念”中一较高下了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "52b2536c7e5f414148d6d94782194f4188960be6d0d45d5a8aa17ee92d8730ba",
